{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Synopsis </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 1979, a man named Masao Satomi was involved in an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> He was taken to the hospital and woke up safe and sound, but had amnesia. When he wonders if there is any memory he can recall, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">he recalls an intense childhood memory from 16 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The nostalgic atmosphere of the Showa period and the somewhat disturbing atmosphere of his childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Masao tries to relive those memories and find out who he is and recover his precious memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Overview </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbTitle 6Days </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbGenre Adventure, Human Mystery, Human Horror </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbPlay time About 2-5 hours </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEndings branching (4 endings in total) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbAge 12 and up recommended</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Others </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game can be enjoyed on its own, but it also contains some of the material from the previous game \u201cRetribution\u201d .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please play \u201cReward-Retribution\u201d as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Guidelines </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regarding video, live streaming, and image posting for this game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All scenes in the game can be posted. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Postings to sites that are offensive to public order and morals or that give a false impression of the game content are prohibited.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853830?t=1753177941","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853830?t=1753177941","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/